//- The brief and the questionnaire a selected tester follows. One page, so the
//- link in the invitation is the whole instruction set; nothing is in an email
//- that is not also here.
extends layout

include partials/footer

block content
  main#content.legal.playtest(data-screen-label="Playtest questionnaire")
    .wrap.legal__inner
      a.legal__home(href="/playtest") ← Paid playtest

      .section-head
        .ornament
          span.rule
          span.diamond
          span.rule
        h1.h2 Your session, and the questions after it
        p.serif-italic About #{study.playMinutes} minutes of play, then #{questionnaire.questions.length} questions. Honest and specific beats polite every time.

      .legal__body
        p.
          This is the whole brief. If you have been offered a place and accepted
          it, everything you need is on this page; if you are reading before
          applying, this is what you would be agreeing to.

        h2.legal__h Before you start
        ol.legal__list
          each step in questionnaire.before
            li= step

        h2.legal__h The questions
        p.
          Answer in your own words, as long or short as you like. There are no
          right answers and nothing is scored — a sentence that says "I had no
          idea what the pickaxe was for" is worth more to us than a paragraph of
          praise.
        ol.legal__list.playtest-questions
          each question in questionnaire.questions
            li= question

        h2.legal__h Two or three details
        ul.legal__list
          each detail in questionnaire.details
            li= detail

        h2.legal__h Sending it
        p
          | Email your answers, your recording or screenshots, and the details above to
          |  #[a(href=`mailto:${study.contactEmail}`)= study.contactEmail]
          |  with your reference — the BW-code you were shown when you applied — in the
          |  subject line. A large recording can be a link to a private upload rather than
          |  an attachment.
        p.
          You have #{study.deadlineHours} hours from receiving access. If that stops
          being realistic, say so before it runs out — an extension is a message, not
          a problem. Payment of #{study.fee} is sent by #{study.payoutMethod} within
          #{study.paymentWindowHours} hours of your submission arriving, and it does not
          depend on liking the game, finding bugs, or finishing anything.

        p.legal__meta(style="margin-top:40px")
          | Study terms version #{study.termsVersion}. The full payment conditions are on the
          |  #[a(href="/playtest") application page].

  +footer(links)
